{
  "nodes": [
    {
      "id": "combo-s-nav",
      "type": "text",
      "text": "# 玩家普攻｜受控原请求与运行命中有限验证\n[[计划_玩家普攻连段|接口、算法与验收边界]] · [[AbilitySystem/结构|GAS结构]] · [[GGYGO_流程_玩家普攻连段.canvas|连段流程]]\n当前受控Original、Owned资源、正常无GE/有效GE与两故障中止链已通过相应原生行为门禁。故障叶仍Fail并保留生产Error；正式GA/ABP/Socket/GE/Cue表现、完整动作和联机待验。原生raw严格红测独立保留。",
      "x": 0,
      "y": 0,
      "width": 1510,
      "height": 190,
      "color": "6"
    },
    {
      "id": "combo-s-input",
      "type": "text",
      "text": "## 输入请求边界\nIA_Attack：Pressed配置为上次资产检查点。\nASC 活跃Spec InputPressed → WaitComboInput。\n任务给 SourceStep/RequestId；Combo保存唯一有截止时间Pending。\n激活重试归ASC/Hero；它不替代GA内换段。\n[[Input/结构|输入职责]]",
      "x": 0,
      "y": 280,
      "width": 450,
      "height": 300,
      "color": "4"
    },
    {
      "id": "combo-s-ga",
      "type": "text",
      "text": "## UGGYGOPlayerComboAbility\n继承 UGGYGOGameplayAbility 的原请求协议。\nInitializeAbilityActivation / ActivateAbilityBody接收已签发Original；ResourceActivation只保存资源来源。\n段序、段token、窗口与唯一Pending归Combo。\nStartStep外调返回核对Original/段/原Task。\nCleanupAbilityResourcesForTermination只释放匹配原资源；终止证明/Completed归基类。\n正常完成按Authority复制；运行命中依赖/Builder故障直接原End(true,true)。\n正式GA父类/默认值本批未迁移。\n[[AbilitySystem/计划_原请求终止|原终止契约]]",
      "x": 530,
      "y": 280,
      "width": 450,
      "height": 390,
      "color": "5"
    },
    {
      "id": "combo-s-config",
      "type": "text",
      "text": "## FGGYGOComboStep[] / GA配置\nMontage、Main/End、NextStepIndex、PlayRate、Damage/PoiseDamage、Socket/Radius。\nValidateComboConfiguration校验动作前置。\nDamageEffect空且Shared关闭=明确无GE；有效Override或明确Shared=必需GE。\n非法已选GE不替换另一个模式；缺失必需Shared明确失败。\n资产值与窗口由GA/Montage配置；本批未验正式接线。",
      "x": 1060,
      "y": 280,
      "width": 450,
      "height": 340,
      "color": "4"
    },
    {
      "id": "combo-s-task",
      "type": "text",
      "text": "## Montage Task / WaitComboInput\nCombo持原Task和各自native注册token。\nMontage Task消费ASC TryPlayMontageWithOwnership的原播放证明及有效速率；watchdog用实际剩余时长。\n输入Task消费真实GAS新按下与复制事件。\nOnDestroy归各Task：退原回调/输入/动画事件，停止原Montage，释放原缩放。\nTaskOwnerEnded使原Task Finished/OwnerFinished；UGameplayAbility唯一持有并退休ActiveTasks登记。\n早GA数据广播前业务清理完成，不等于原生账本已空。\n[[AbilitySystem/结构|共享播放接口]]",
      "x": 530,
      "y": 750,
      "width": 450,
      "height": 390,
      "color": "5"
    },
    {
      "id": "combo-s-anim",
      "type": "text",
      "text": "## Montage / Notify / AnimBP\n三份Main→End、FullBody、窗口为上次资产检查点。\nGameplayEventWindow载荷：Montage/主Mesh/InstanceID+1。\nTask校验原实例与播放证明，GA校验原段/主Mesh。\nComboWindow与HitWindow各自表达窗口语义。\nAnimBP只负责Slot/表现；位移归CMC。\n正式GA/ABP与移动完整接线待验。\n[[Animation/结构|动画职责]]",
      "x": 1060,
      "y": 750,
      "width": 450,
      "height": 330,
      "color": "1"
    },
    {
      "id": "combo-s-hit",
      "type": "text",
      "text": "## Hero MeleeTrace / Builder / GE / Cue\nHeroCharacter持MeleeTraceComponent。\n服务器TryOpenOwnedTraceWindow→签发原窗口；SubscribeWindowHit→原Window/Actor/HitResult。\nCombat唯一做采样/去重/Tick；不决策伤害/GA终止。\nCombo校验Original/段/Task/Window，再BuildHitEffectPayload→Spec与Cue数据。\n合法GE经ASC Apply→GE/Execution/AttributeSet；显式无GE只走合法Cue。\nUnsubscribeWindowHit/CloseOwnedTraceWindow精确退原资源。\n[[Combat/结构|查询契约]] · [[GGYGO_流程_伤害结算.canvas|伤害链]]",
      "x": 0,
      "y": 750,
      "width": 450,
      "height": 390,
      "color": "4"
    },
    {
      "id": "combo-s-network",
      "type": "text",
      "text": "## 强类型纠正与完成边界\nWaitComboInput：SourceStep + RequestId。\nClientCorrectAbilityState(Spec,key,TargetData)只筛来源并转发。\nFGGYGOComboCorrectionData归Combo：段/位置/窗口/Revision；ReceiveAbilityCorrection核对单项确切类型与范围。\nRequestAbilityEnd/Cancel消费固定Original；结果历史不是新调用权限。\nGA数据、ASC本地通知、Completed三种事件各有自己的字段/时点契约。\n下一激活由原请求/回调返回后的受控调用方继续。\nraw来源无外层受控Try见证可清资源，但不发布协议Completed；联机未验。",
      "x": 530,
      "y": 1230,
      "width": 650,
      "height": 390,
      "color": "5"
    }
  ],
